  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>When you choose the University of Scranton, you’re becoming part of a nationally recognised Jesuit institution. Whether you're pursuing a degree in business, the sciences, health professions, or the humanities, you’ll have a great academic journey at Scranton.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>You'll be meeting students from all over the world at Scranton. Plus, with over 90 active clubs and organisations, you’ll always have something to do. On campus, the Centre for Student Engagement serves as the hub for student activities, offering events, leadership development, and involvement opportunities. Not just that, you’ll also have free and confidential counselling services from the Counselling Centre.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>The University of Scranton provides you with accommodation located near the centre of the campus. All residence halls are equipped with wired and wireless internet.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><i>Additionally, if you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to </i><a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\"><i>download our app</i></a><i> and check out the Stays feature!</i></p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>The Weinberg Memorial Library gives you extensive print and digital collections, along with study spaces. Here, you’ll also find specialised areas like the Pro Deo Room, which includes a computer lab and cafe.</p><p><strong>Sports</strong><br>The University of Scranton offers you various athletic and recreational facilities. These include facilities like the Byron Recreation Complex, where you’ll find multi-purpose courts, a six-lane pool, racquetball courts, a dance/aerobics room, and a fitness centre. You’ll also find separate fields for baseball, softball, soccer, lacrosse, and field hockey.</p><p><strong>Laboratory</strong><br>As a student at Scranton, you’ll have access to the Loyola Science Centre. This facility features modern laboratories, classrooms, and research spaces.</p><p><strong>Cafeteria</strong><br>You can get freshly prepared meals at the Fresh Food Company, on the third floor of the DeNaples Centre. You can also grab quick bites and beverages at the Scranton Market, a 24/7 self-service market situated on the first floor of the Weinberg Memorial Library.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
